# Goes to GitHub: the web prototype, plus the connector's reply-card page and its download (2026-11-02).
# Everything else stays local, including design proposals, working notes and the connector source.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/bct-crm-ui/
!/bct-crm-mcp/
/bct-crm-mcp/*
!/bct-crm-mcp/docs/
!/bct-crm-mcp/dist/
.DS_Store
/bct-crm-ui/README.md
# Design proposals stay local; only the design system is published
/bct-crm-ui/docs/*
!/bct-crm-ui/docs/design-system.html
# Original photos; the pages use the 256px copies one level up
/bct-crm-ui/assets/people/src/
